    {
      "source": "Obtain the underlying redis specific <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/convert/EntityConverter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>EntityConverter</code></a>.",
      "translation": "获取底层的 Redis 特定<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/convert/EntityConverter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>EntityConverter</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<small>Copyright © 2011–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>. All rights reserved.</small>",
      "translation": "<small>版权所有 © 2011–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>。保留所有权利。</small>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Retrieve entities by resolving their ids and converting them into required type. <br/>\nThe callback provides either a single id or an <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Iterable.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Iterable</code></a> of ids, used for retrieving\nthe actual domain types and shortcuts manual retrieval and conversion of ids via <a href=\"RedisTemplate.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.core\"><code>RedisTemplate</code></a>.\n\n<pre><code>\nList&lt;RedisSession&gt; sessions = template.find(new RedisCallback&lt;Set&lt;byte[]&gt;&gt;() {\n  public Set&lt;byte[]&lt; doInRedis(RedisConnection connection) throws DataAccessException {\n    return connection\n      .sMembers(\"spring:session:sessions:securityContext.authentication.principal.username:user\"\n        .getBytes());\n  }\n}, RedisSession.class);\n</code>\n</pre>",
      "translation": "通过解析其 ID 并将其转换为所需类型来检索实体。<br/>\n回调提供单个 ID 或一个 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Iterable.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Iterable</code></a> 的 ID，用于检索实际的域类型，并简化通过 <a href=\"RedisTemplate.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.core\"><code>RedisTemplate</code></a> 手动检索和转换 ID 的操作。\n\n<pre><code>\nList&lt;RedisSession&gt; sessions = template.find(new RedisCallback&lt;Set&lt;byte[]&gt;&gt;() {\n  public Set&lt;byte[]&lt; doInRedis(RedisConnection connection) throws DataAccessException {\n    return connection\n      .sMembers(\"spring:session:sessions:securityContext.authentication.principal.username:user\"\n        .getBytes());\n  }\n}, RedisSession.class);\n</code>\n</pre>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
